Z||000000||FieroHarry||04-13-2001||09:26 AM||||I just got myhands on a new set of rims.<BR>Whatis the best way to polish the outer alum lip and get it shiny new looking?<BR>I tried to polish up a spoke (generic) rim before and noticed if you damage the outer coating they start to look like $%^&*.<BR>Any idea's?||||reg||6
